==German==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|de|Alptraum}} {{q|standard spelling until 1996; still correct, but disfavoured and becoming less common}}

===Etymology===
{{compound|de|Alb|Traum}}, because nightmares in some forms of German folklore are thought to be caused by an elf sitting on one's chest while one slept.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈalptʁaʊ̯m/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Alptraum.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
